title: Minor Funk in Twelve
key: Gm
tempo: 70
meter: 12/8
style: funk

// Four slow pulses to the bar, three eighths in each. Thirty-two bars, AABA.
// The A sits on the minor one and its dorian four, and turns home from the
// flat six through the five, a chord a half bar. The bridge goes up to the
// flat six and the five, back to the one and the four, and climbs through the
// flat seven to the five, suspended and then sharp nine.
[A]
| Gm9 | % | C9       | %   |
| Gm9 | % | Eb9 D7#9 | Gm9 |

[A]

[Bridge]
| Ebmaj7 | D7#9 | Gm9    | C9   |
| Ebmaj7 | F9   | D9sus4 | D7#9 |

[A]
